# From AgentE382
NOTE: Original x86 instructions are commented-out with 16-bit Thumb instructions underneath. Once 16-bit Thumb is done, I'll move to Thumb2, then ARM32, then aarch64.

Original README
---------------
This is a mirror of Richard WM Jones's excellent literate x86 assembly
implementation of Forth, more on which here:
http://rwmj.wordpress.com/2010/08/07/jonesforth-git-repository/
